Cortext WebAssembly Binding Notices
===================================

This package (`@augmem/cortext-wasm`) is the browser WebAssembly language
binding for Cortext. The TypeScript/JavaScript wrapper is Apache-2.0.

Vendored Emscripten outputs (`assets/cortext.js`, `assets/cortext.wasm`) are
built from the Cortext engine (https://github.com/augmem/cortext) and inherit
that project's third-party obligations. Engine-side third-party components
commonly include:

SQLite
------

Upstream: https://sqlite.org/
License: Public domain for the SQLite deliverable code and documentation.

sqlite-vec
----------

Upstream: https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-vec
License: Dual MIT OR Apache-2.0.

sqlite-objstore
---------------

Upstream: https://github.com/augmem/sqlite-objstore
License: Apache-2.0.

BLAKE3
------

Upstream: https://github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3
License: CC0-1.0, with Apache-2.0 and Apache-2.0 with LLVM exceptions texts
also bundled by upstream for consumers who prefer those terms.

Emscripten runtime glue
-----------------------

The generated `assets/cortext.js` loader is produced by the Emscripten
toolchain (https://emscripten.org/). Refer to the Emscripten project for
runtime license terms applicable to the generated glue.

For the authoritative engine NOTICE, see the matching release of
https://github.com/augmem/cortext.
